Dialogue: 2,0:23:06.74,0:23:13.49,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}冷めないで　邪魔しないから
Dialogue: 2,0:23:13.49,0:23:17.83,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}わたし灰色景色
Dialogue: 2,0:23:17.83,0:23:24.17,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}なんで気になってるの？
Dialogue: 2,0:23:24.17,0:23:28.43,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}わたし良いとこないよ
Dialogue: 2,0:23:28.43,0:23:33.33,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}好き…(すき…)嫌い…(きらい…)　わかんないけど
Dialogue: 2,0:23:33.56,0:23:38.69,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}心拍バグってる　君のせい
Dialogue: 2,0:23:38.69,0:23:45.40,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}普通の恋じゃなくても　綺麗じゃなくても
Dialogue: 2,0:23:45.40,0:23:49.86,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}自分らしく それでいいじゃん
Dialogue: 2,0:23:49.86,0:23:57.50,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}不器用でも届けたい想いがあるの
Dialogue: 2,0:23:57.50,0:24:01.01,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}ナイショだけどホンキだよ
